  "details": "Your in an event world with your friends, You already waited 20 minutes to get in.\n\nYou and your friend are in!\n\n10 minutes later\n\n***THUNK*** you get a vrchat timeout error, that means you left the world and you have to re-queue for the world, Now this seems pretty unfair because its a cermenstance that you cannot control.\n\nOffering users to automatically bypass/reenter a world when disconnected from a full instance, by either holding their player slot for a set time say, 30-60 seconds after they disconnect to allow them to automatically rejoin without any issues or disrupting their night by getting kicked out of an event because of an internet blip",
